{"id":"vollkommen","lemma":"vollkommen","pos":"adj","rank":1203,"glosses":["perfect (fitting its definition precisely)","complete"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f8/De-vollkommen.ogg/De-vollkommen.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"vollkommener","superlative":"am vollkommensten"},"examples":[{"text":"Niemand ist vollkommen.","en":"No one's perfect.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392597","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Keine Frau ist vollkommen.","en":"No woman is perfect.","words":[{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"woman"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Ich vertraue ihm vollkommen.","en":"I trust him completely.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755567","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to trust","l":"vertrauen"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"er"},null]},{"text":"Das ist vollkommener Blödsinn.","en":"That's utter nonsense.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"rubbish, nonsense"}]},{"text":"Er ist nicht vollkommen.","en":"He isn't perfect.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/767527","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},null]}]}